WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.701
-Everyone, the NBA Draft
is tomorrow,

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:05.137
and earlier, I got to hang out
with a few of the top prospects

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:07.974
over Zoom and shoot
some virtual hoops.

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:11.911
And, you know, there's sore
losers and sore winners.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:13.213
You know?

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:14.914
Let's just say that.
Anyways, let's take a look.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:17.083
We had some fun.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:20.053
Hey, guys, I'm here with
some of the top NBA prospects,

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:23.323 line:0%
Anthony Edwards, James Wiseman,
and Obi Toppin,

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:24.724
and I thought it'd be fun
to challenge them

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.627
to a little two-on-two
on the only court

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:30.429
I might be able to keep up --
the PlayStation.

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:31.831
Let's do this.

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.599
Dude, I'm gonna talk smack.

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:35.068
I'm ready to go, man.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:37.069
James, you're my teammate.
-Alright.

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:38.404
-Who are you gonna play with?

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:40.173
-I'm over here
with Kyrie Irving.

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:42.241
-I'm Kobe. Ant, who you getting?

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:43.242
-I'm Michael Jordan.

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:44.610
-Really? Kobe, Michel Jordan?

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.346
Alright, James,
who should I pick?

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:47.647
-Oh, yeah, Kareem.

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.648
-Oh, Kareem Abdul-Jabbar.
I'll be Kareem.

00:00:49.648 --> 00:00:50.850 line:0%
[ Whistle blows ]
Alright, here we go.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.253 line:0%
-Alley-oop, alley-oop is L2,
Ant.

00:00:54.253 --> 00:00:56.122 line:0%
-Yow! Please!

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:59.325 line:0%
How's it going, Jordan?!
All good!

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:00.994 line:0%
Oh! [ Laughs ]

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:03.463 line:0%
Oh, my God! It's a blowout!

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:04.931 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:08.801 line:0%
-Yes! Oh, you bricked it!

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:10.069 line:0%
-Why my man not shoot?

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:11.537 line:0%
-It's not his fault, Ant.

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:13.806 line:0%
Go, go, go, go, go, Kyrie, go.

00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:15.207 line:0%
-Get back.

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:17.944 line:0%
-Oh, my gosh!
It's a one-man team.

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:19.812 line:0%
I haven't done anything good
for the team at all.

00:01:19.812 --> 00:01:21.648 line:0%
But it doesn't matter, James.
We're on it.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.652 line:0%
Oh, my God! The skyhook!

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:27.320 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:30.756 line:0%
-What's going on?

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:33.225 line:0%
-Oh, my God! It's no contest!

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:35.261 line:0%
-Hey, he know how to play, brah.
I don't know how to play.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:36.996 line:0%
-We good, we good.

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:38.965 line:0%
-Jordan, don't hurt him.

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:40.333 line:0%
-Dang, man.

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:41.333 line:0%
-God darn it.

00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:43.036 line:0%
-Here we go, here we go.

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:47.440 line:0%
-Oh!

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:48.507 line:0%
-Gosh.

00:01:48.507 --> 00:01:50.276 line:0%
-I just slammed on y'all.

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:54.413 line:0%
-Buh-tuh-tuh-tuh-tuh-tuh.

00:01:54.413 --> 00:01:56.515 line:0%
Ba-hoo!
Happy Thanksgiving.

00:01:56.515 --> 00:01:59.185 line:0%
There's the stuffing
in the turkey right there!

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.087 line:0%
-Y'all cheating.
Y'all got hacks on here.

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.588 line:0%
-[ Laughs ] I'm not cheating.

00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:04.357 line:0%
Obi. [ Laughs ]

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:06.792 line:0%
Obi with the brick.
-Man!

00:02:06.792 --> 00:02:09.095 line:0%
-It's a close game, 33-18.

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:11.230 line:0%
-We need to come back, Ant.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:14.634 line:0%
-Go, go, go, run,
run, run, turbo!

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.035 line:0%
Boing!

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:18.304 line:0%
-Ooh!
-Oy, oy, oy, oy, oy!

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:19.672
[ Whistle blows ]

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:21.974
-Guys, Team Jimmy Jams
for the win.

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:25.811
Good luck. I cannot wait to see
you guys in the NBA, man.

00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:28.314
-Hey, Ant, we need to play them
in real life two-on-two.

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:29.515
-Yeah, for sure.

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:32.085
-Leave meeting, leave meeting,
leave meeting.

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:34.120
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.421
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:38.457
My thanks again to
Anthony Edwards, James Wiseman,

00:02:38.457 --> 00:02:39.859
and Obi Toppin!

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:41.227
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:44.931
The NBA Draft is tomorrow at
8:00 p.m. Eastern on ESPN.

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:46.432
Good luck to all the players.

